775
00:47:18,707 --> 00:47:20,417
-Faça isso de novo.
-Entendeu?

776
00:47:20,459 --> 00:47:22,878
-Sim, entendi, entendi.
-Beleza.

777
00:47:33,305 --> 00:47:34,806
Oi.
